    "title": "Between You and Me: The exquisite joy of becoming a great-grandparent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leah Dunaief ,\n5 hours ago Yesterday I became a great-grandmother. Now it wasn’t unexpected. We have known that my oldest grandchild and his wife were going to have a baby for months. Nonetheless, when she finally arrived, it sent the family rocketing into outer space with happiness. Her name is Evelyn Ilene, she clocked in at eight pounds one ounce and 21 inches, she has dark hair and shortly after arrival, she opened her eyes and looked around to see where and with whom she had landed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
